 on cc5c1cf

J1-J3 are now regression tests: the late-writer probe is blocked by
BEGIN IMMEDIATE (and fails on the pre-fix 8a3db5c), the file is 0600
whatever the umask, a symlinked path or a group-readable directory is
refused, an existing public file is refused without chmod. New: six
processes creating the same journal at once lose nothing. J4/J5 pinned.

